  "category": "modding",
  "description": "c3844 runtime matrix smoke: source-only catalog load batch 8 for extracted non-Scenario public typed archives. Missing debug-load request/result blocks are B-509 harness observability failures.",
  "tags": [
    "modding",
    "pdxxx",
    "source-gate",
    "source-matrix",
    "all-family",
    "c3844",
    "smoke",
    "pillar:modding"
  ],
